     On pages 45-61 of this report we have reproduced the=20
narrative reports of the principal executives of Blue Chip and=20
Wesco, in which they describe 1982 operations.  A copy of the=20
full annual report of either company will be mailed to any=20
Berkshire shareholder upon request to Mr. Robert H. Bird for=20
